    lgo:sourceElement "/law/section[1]/paragraph[1]" ;
    lgo:sourceUrl "https://oag.ca.gov/system/files/media/pea-sephora-filed-judgment.pdf"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lgo:text "11. To the extent DEFENDANT SELLS the PERSONAL INFORMATION of CONSUMERS, including through SALES USING ONLINE TRACKING TECHNOLOGY, DEFENDANT shall provide notice to CONSUMERS as required by Civil Code section 1798.135, subdivision (a) that clearly states that it SELLS their PERSONAL INFORMATION, and that CONSUMERS have the right to opt-out of all SALES."@en .

